	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Ghostty — Tabs &amp; Splits

gt — search &amp; jump across ALL Ghostty tabs and splits
  · Match dimensions: terminal title, tab title, full working directory,
    running foreground process (via pid), tty
  · ↩ : jump (bring window to front, select tab, focus the surface)
  · ⌃↩ : copy the surface's full working directory
  · ⌘C on a result: copy path (Alfred native)

go — open a folder in a new tab / window
  · No argument: opens Finder's current folder (falls back to home if no Finder window)
  · go ~/Workspaces/foo: directory completion, Tab drills down, ↩ opens
  · ⌘↩ : open in a new window (cold-starts Ghostty if it is not running)

UI language follows your system's preferred language (Chinese or English).

Requirements: macOS, Alfred 5 + Powerpack, Ghostty &gt;= 1.4
First run: allow Alfred to control Ghostty (and Finder for go's Finder fallback).</string>
